USER   or indentation.
USER - If a pre-existing (non-TODO) comment looks WRONG or outdated, do NOT fix it and do NOT
USER   rewrite it. Leave it untouched. Reviewers will capture such issues separately. Your job
USER   is strictly to fill the placeholders, not to improve surrounding prose.
